# Folders that do not get their own AGENTS.md; they use the nearest
# ancestor's. Gitignore syntax. Dot-folders and gitignored paths are always
# skipped. scripts/check-agents-md.ts reads this file.

# Generated output: `pnpm tokens` writes it
tokens/generated/

# Check fixtures and stories: checks/AGENTS.md covers them;
# fixtures/src/** mirrors src/, so src/AGENTS.md's rules apply there
checks/fixtures/
checks/stories/

# Foundation stories and docs: src/AGENTS.md holds their rules
src/foundations/

# The API report, written by `pnpm api:update`: the root AGENTS.md (Releases) covers it
api/
